{
  "title": "Atlantis Rising",
  "about": "Moses parts the sea and finds Atlantis, overrun by dolphins with thumbs. The walls of water part over a cycle of beats (or through the song section, fully open by the drop), hold, then crash shut; Moses raises his staff on the beat; the crystal spire pulses on the kick; dolphins leap across the gap giving thumbs up.",
